                        content:
                          '<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class="qml-stem" data-copyright="xkw.com-1703680096-103501685673896300-yb3eMt6dU7OXP0zvFb9E4wPVJVg92_kU0eY8UhIL0xjztfUZLs4-PQ6HHlJ2HUQo"><p style=""><span style="font-family: 宋体;">分别用百分数、分数、小数表示直线上的各点。</span></p><p style=""><img  src="https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/2022/1/20/2898580660436992/2898769615446016/STEM/5795eb28-d398-4610-9e3a-616ad0d886e9.png" width="388" height="145" /></p></div>',
