                        gapFillingAnswer: null,
                        type: 5,
                        analysis:
                          '<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class="qml-explanation" data-copyright="xkw.com-1714037665-103501685673896300-rxXjM319rbqsS3itMNhcogcJcaMUwm9Ywmgqa4COKBVMoQTGGMyOggb6MlkqDxEh"><div class="qml-seg" seg-name="分析">【分析】<p style=""><span>根据题意，图分为两部分，左边每个大正方形都表示</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">“</span><span>1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">”，右边把正方形平均分成</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">100</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">份，阴影部分为</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">份，用小数表示是</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">0.02</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，与左边的</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">个单位“</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">”合起来是</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">2.02</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">，据此解答。</span></p></div><div class="qml-seg" seg-name="详解">【详解】<p style=""><span>根据分析得：下边每个大正方形都表示整数</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">“</span><span>1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">”</span><span>，图中涂色部分用小数表示是2.02。</span></p></div><div class="qml-seg" seg-name="点睛">【点睛】<span>熟练掌握小数的意义是本题解答的关键。</span><span style="style: caret-color: red;;"><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\'" qml-space-size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><br  /></div></div>',
