                        content:
                          '<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class="qml-stem" data-copyright="xkw.com-1710911543-103501685673896300-19beU2cXFeALSzBMU0qbygcJcaMUwm9Ywmgqa4COKBU2eb8p8m-Eg8WEJt5xLPJj"><p style="text-align:justify;word-break:break-word"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">作图题。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;word-break:break-word"><img  src="https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2023/9/15/0aac577a-177b-4eda-8813-e3075cbee8d9.png" width="443" height="122" source-file="https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2023/9/15/0aac577a-177b-4eda-8813-e3075cbee8d9.ai" /><span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\'" qml-space-size="2">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="text-align:justify;word-break:break-word"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">）画出一个平行四边形，并画一条线段，使其分成两个梯形。</span></p><p style="text-align:justify;word-break:break-word"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">（</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">）画出一个直角三角形，并画出这个三角形的</span><span style="font-family: \'Times New Roman\';">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;">条高。</span></p></div>',
